{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧第一段的大号白色文字最先进入视线，字号大、对比强、位置靠上；随后中间和下方两段同样醒目的白字分走注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他在一段亲近关系中，开始渴望得到一个不会改变的承诺，但知道没人能保证永远。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"贪心、缺乏安全感、隐约不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他担心对方有一天不再需要自己，因此想把喜欢藏回去，减少未来受伤；但他其实已经无法装作不在乎，收回喜欢反而更难受。这层矛盾需要结合后两段才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块大号白字都很显眼，彼此争夺主视线，缺少明确的主次层级。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在三块文字中：想要永远的承诺、害怕失去亲近、无法收回真心，需要拼接才能理解完整的处境与情绪关系。\",\n    \"第一段本身也是较长的复合句，需要读到后半句才能理解他对永远的承诺其实并不抱希望。\",\n    \"两组彩色短语连续排列，增加了额外的信息选择负担。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "476c8456-89f9-4a86-a422-6c4631b7e1ca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T033203812155Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:32:50.498715+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd70d8a9174eec4cdcfccb5c422b684eeef1354a281996e3337746867c234af1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py"